-&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ATTENTION PARENTS!  Please remember that unless your student&#39;s address information is current and accurate in the District&#39;s database, we cannot ensure he or she is scheduled for transportation on the right bus to the right location. Please get to your child&#39;s school IMMEDIATELY after changing your address or contact information. That information not only improves the safety of the transportation evolution, it also helps ensure your child receives the appropriate student services and that the District can reach you in the event of an emergency.&lt;br /&gt;
